# Internal engineering artifacts — dispatcher state, task charters, debug reports,
# blind verification sets, raw diagnostic dumps. This repository is PUBLIC and ships
# a distributable Obsidian plugin; those artifacts carry local filesystem paths and
# are not part of the product. They live in their own PRIVATE repository, checked out
# in place at workflowArtifacts/ (a nested git repo), with the full 305-commit history
# carried over by `git subtree split`. Nothing was discarded — see that repo.
/workflowArtifacts/
